Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.32,0:00:04.55,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And what a way to finish for Ekaterina Alexandrova.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N亚历山德罗娃精彩收官！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:06.73,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}6{\fs68}号下午
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:09.02,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}中网女单{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}8{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.02,0:00:11.12,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}今年温网冠军诺斯科娃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:13.09,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}美网之后{\fs78}5{\fs68}场全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:13.98,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}但这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.98,0:00:16.96,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}她的反扑为什么没能奏效？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.34,0:00:34.65,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Drops in. Nicely done. Backhand side from Noskova.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N落进界内！诺斯科娃反手得分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:37.88,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}诺斯科娃的反手也能打出制胜分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.88,0:00:38.93,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}先保发之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.93,0:00:41.82,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}她在对手发球局拿到{\fs78}3{\fs68}次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.82,0:00:44.48,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}先是{\fs78}40{\fs68}比{\fs78}15{\fs68} 再一次占先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:46.49,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}却全被救下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.26,0:01:04.68,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Great hands. Yeah.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N手上功夫真好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.68,0:01:07.91,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There's the drop shot and great coverage at the net.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N放短后 网前覆盖很到位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:10.79,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}诺斯科娃在网前还能抢分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.79,0:01:12.63,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}底线却开始承压
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.63,0:01:15.47,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}亚历山德罗娃的反手打得又深又快
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:17.28,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}接发也敢直接抢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:20.19,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}看首盘的两次关键破发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.05,0:01:32.36,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's a big backhand from Alexandrova.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N亚历山德罗娃这记反手很有威力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.12,0:01:43.76,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So, Alexandrova gets the first break of the opening set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N亚历山德罗娃完成首盘首次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.94,0:01:47.52,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Can just react, get that return back in play.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N及时反应 把接发球送回场内
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.99,0:01:54.09,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Good return again from Alexandrova.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又一次漂亮接发！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.19,0:01:56.11,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And she has a double-break lead.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她已经领先两个破发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:01:57.11,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Bit of a surprise.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N确实有些出人意料
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:08.10,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Backhand for Alexandrova to close out the opening set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这记反手 首盘拿下！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.45,0:02:11.35,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So, two breaks of serve, and she hands Linda Noskova{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两次破发 让诺斯科娃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.35,0:02:14.51,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}her first set loss in her last six matches.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N最近六场比赛首次丢盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.14,0:02:18.03,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}An upset brewing perhaps in round four.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第四轮 冷门正在酝酿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.36,0:02:20.01,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.01,0:02:22.34,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}第二盘 诺斯科娃又先保发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.34,0:02:25.11,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}再在对手发球局拿到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.11,0:02:28.51,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}这是全场第四次机会 也是最后一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.51,0:02:30.62,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}她依然没能兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.70,0:02:40.75,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, wow!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 太漂亮了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.30,0:02:45.24,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}打到{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 诺斯科娃还没有掉队
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.24,0:02:47.98,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}可随后自己的两个发球局都失守
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:49.78,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}她连丢最后{\fs78}4{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.78,0:02:53.31,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}对手的第二盘{\fs78}8{\fs68}个一发球 全部得分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.70,0:02:57.42,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}制胜分 诺斯科娃{\fs78}8{\fs68}记 对手{\fs78}32{\fs68}记
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.42,0:02:59.68,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}第二盘更是{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}19{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:02.14,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}次破发机会又全都错过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.14,0:03:05.05,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}她始终没能把反扑变成比分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.40,0:03:07.63,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}温网冠军暂时停步
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.63,0:03:10.57,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}亚历山德罗娃首次打进中网八强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.57,0:03:13.30,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}下一轮对米拉 安德烈耶娃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.30,0:03:16.11,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}诺斯科娃下一站能再起势吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.11,0:03:18.69,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}最后一分 交给现场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:26.67,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And what a way to finish for Ekaterina Alexandrova.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N亚历山德罗娃精彩收官！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.77,0:03:30.70,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A dominant effort against the Wimbledon champion{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N面对温网冠军 她打得很强势
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.17,0:03:33.32,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}who hasn't lost since the US Open.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对手从美网之后就没输过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:36.92,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Had a five-match win streak going that is now gone.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N此前的五连胜 现在终结了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:42.22,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ekaterina Alexandrova into the quarterfinals in Beijing for the very first time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N亚历山德罗娃首次中网八强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.52,0:03:44.97,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Two and two over the number five seed.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两个六比二 击败五号种子
